; Module 6, Lab 6.5: the instructor's "threat feed" (a response policy zone).
; Names are under the lab TLD example.; see example.additions.
$TTL 60
@        SOA ns1.example. admin.example. 1 300 60 86400 60
         NS  ns1.example.
; QNAME triggers
malware.example          CNAME .                        ; NXDOMAIN
phish.example            CNAME walled-garden.example.   ; redirect (local data)
tracker.example          CNAME *.                       ; NODATA
; response IP trigger: any answer containing 192.0.2.66
32.66.2.0.192.rpz-ip     CNAME .                        ; NXDOMAIN
